# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What the repository tracks (submission view)
#   README.md                                 setup guide and findings for the marker
#   notebooks/Group10_EDA_Code.ipynb          graded notebook, 5 pts
#   Discussion_Slides/Group10_EDA_Slides.pdf  graded report pages, 15 pts
#   data/raw/README.md                        where to place the course extract
#   requirements.txt                          pinned environment, pip route
#   environment.yml                           the same pins as a conda environment
#
# Everything else is local working material, regenerated by the build or held
# for the group's own use, so it stays out of the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Internal build machinery, docs site source, course material, private notes
extra/

# Generated figures and editable slide sources (built by extra/src/run_all.py)
reports/

# Virtual environment and Python artefacts
dt_mining/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.tmp
*.bak
*._build.pdf
.ipynb_checkpoints/
notebooks/*_failed.ipynb

# Course extract is not redistributed; cleaned output is generated
data/raw/acdc_dataset.csv
data/processed/
References/

# Built MkDocs site
site/

# Nothing else may contain a PDF; the submission report page is the exception
*.pdf
!Discussion_Slides/Group10_EDA_Slides.pdf

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
